type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Paradeluxe/jprism-bilingual"
keywords:
  - jacobian-lens
  - mechanistic-interpretability
  - multilingual
  - logit-lens
  - bilingualism
abstract: >-
  Fitting, measurement, audit, and analysis code for a controlled comparison of
  Jacobian lenses fitted on English WikiText, Chinese Wikipedia and Russian
  Wikipedia corpora, applied to thirteen checkpoints from five model families
  (0.6B to 27B parameters) on 300 probes asked in all three languages. Depends on
  anthropics/jacobian-lens (Apache-2.0). Corresponding author: Haoyun Zhang.
